  "description": "Generated models, converters, and the method table for the Agent Client Protocol v2\n      line. Reflection-free: every contract is produced by the System.Text.Json source\n      generator, so the assembly is trimmable and AOT-compatible.\n\n        PREVIEW: no agent implements ACP v2 yet. The schema is still tagged 2.0.0-alpha,\n        the reference Rust SDK gates v2 behind an opt-in unstable_protocol_v2 feature, and\n        the TypeScript SDK has no v2 surface at all. Use the V1 packages for anything real.",
